  "text": "### Digital Records  \n**Secure Deletion:**\n- Data overwriting (DoD standard, 3-pass)\n- Encrypted deletion (AES-256)\n- Physical destruction (hard drives)  \n**Process:**\n1. Identify files to destroy\n2. Quarantine to destruction folder\n3. Secure delete (not just recycle bin)\n4. Verify deletion\n5. Certificate generated  \n---",
